@startuml Basic Abstract Factory Pattern

' Define the styles
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold
skinparam classBackgroundColor #f8f9fa
skinparam classBorderColor #dee2e6
skinparam arrowColor #6c757d
skinparam stereotypeCBackgroundColor #e9ecef

' Title
title Basic Abstract Factory Pattern - Core Structure

' Abstract Factory Interface
interface CommissionSystemFactory <<AbstractFactory>> {
  +createCommissionCalculator(): CommissionCalculator
  +createDealValidator(): DealValidator
}

' Abstract Product Interfaces
interface CommissionCalculator <<AbstractProduct>> {
  +calculateCommission(deal: Deal, salesRep: User): CommissionCalculation
}

interface DealValidator <<AbstractProduct>> {
  +validateDeal(deal: Deal): boolean
  +getInvalidReason(deal: Deal): String
}

' Concrete Factories
class StandardCommissionSystemFactory <<ConcreteFactory>> {
  +createCommissionCalculator(): CommissionCalculator
  +createDealValidator(): DealValidator
}

class PremiumCommissionSystemFactory <<ConcreteFactory>> {
  +createCommissionCalculator(): CommissionCalculator
  +createDealValidator(): DealValidator
}

' Concrete Products - Calculator Family
class StandardCommissionCalculator <<ConcreteProduct>> {
  +calculateCommission(deal: Deal, salesRep: User): CommissionCalculation
  --
  <i>Calculates 5% commission</i>
}

class PremiumCommissionCalculator <<ConcreteProduct>> {
  +calculateCommission(deal: Deal, salesRep: User): CommissionCalculation
  --
  <i>Calculates 8% commission</i>
}

' Concrete Products - Validator Family
class BasicDealValidator <<ConcreteProduct>> {
  +validateDeal(deal: Deal): boolean
  +getInvalidReason(deal: Deal): String
  --
  <i>Validates: value > 0</i>
}

class AdvancedDealValidator <<ConcreteProduct>> {
  +validateDeal(deal: Deal): boolean
  +getInvalidReason(deal: Deal): String
  --
  <i>Validates: value > 0 and has products</i>
}

' Client
class Client <<Client>> {
  -factory: CommissionSystemFactory
  +processCommission(): void
}

' Factory Relationships
CommissionSystemFactory <|.. StandardCommissionSystemFactory
CommissionSystemFactory <|.. PremiumCommissionSystemFactory

' Product Relationships
CommissionCalculator <|.. StandardCommissionCalculator
CommissionCalculator <|.. PremiumCommissionCalculator
DealValidator <|.. BasicDealValidator
DealValidator <|.. AdvancedDealValidator

' Factory-Product Creation Relationships
StandardCommissionSystemFactory ..> StandardCommissionCalculator : creates
StandardCommissionSystemFactory ..> BasicDealValidator : creates
PremiumCommissionSystemFactory ..> PremiumCommissionCalculator : creates
PremiumCommissionSystemFactory ..> AdvancedDealValidator : creates

' Client Dependencies
Client o--> "1" CommissionSystemFactory : uses
Client ..> CommissionCalculator : uses
Client ..> DealValidator : uses

' Component Notes
note right of CommissionSystemFactory
  <b>Abstract Factory</b>
  Declares creation methods for
  each product type in the family.

  Ensures all concrete factories
  provide a complete set of
  related products.

  <b>Key Principle:</b>
  Program to an interface, not
  an implementation.
end note

note left of CommissionCalculator
  <b>Abstract Product A</b>
  Defines interface for
  commission calculator products.

  Multiple variants (Standard,
  Premium) implement different
  calculation strategies.
end note

note left of DealValidator
  <b>Abstract Product B</b>
  Defines interface for
  deal validator products.

  Multiple variants (Basic,
  Advanced) implement different
  validation rules.
end note

note bottom of StandardCommissionSystemFactory
  <b>Concrete Factory 1</b>
  Creates <b>Standard family</b> of products:
  • StandardCommissionCalculator (5%)
  • BasicDealValidator (simple rules)

  Products in this family are designed
  to work together consistently.
end note

note bottom of PremiumCommissionSystemFactory
  <b>Concrete Factory 2</b>
  Creates <b>Premium family</b> of products:
  • PremiumCommissionCalculator (8%)
  • AdvancedDealValidator (strict rules)

  Products in this family are designed
  to work together consistently.
end note

note right of Client
  <b>Client Code</b>
  • Works with abstract interfaces only
  • Doesn't know which concrete products it uses
  • Can switch entire product family by
    changing the factory instance

  <b>Example:</b>
  factory = new StandardCommissionSystemFactory();
  calculator = factory.createCommissionCalculator();
  validator = factory.createDealValidator();
end note

' Pattern Summary
note top of CommissionSystemFactory
  <b>Abstract Factory Pattern Components:</b>

  <b>AbstractFactory:</b> Interface for creating
  families of related/dependent objects.

  <b>ConcreteFactory:</b> Implements operations
  to create concrete product objects.

  <b>AbstractProduct:</b> Interface for a type
  of product object.

  <b>ConcreteProduct:</b> Defines a product
  object to be created by the corresponding
  concrete factory; implements AbstractProduct.

  <b>Client:</b> Uses only interfaces declared
  by AbstractFactory and AbstractProduct.

  <b>Key Benefits:</b>
  • Isolates concrete classes
  • Makes exchanging product families easy
  • Promotes consistency among products
  • Supports Open/Closed Principle

  <b>Intent:</b>
  Provide an interface for creating families
  of related or dependent objects without
  specifying their concrete classes.
end note

@enduml